  "title": "One-Skillet Hearty Chili and Cornbread",
  "description": "This one-skillet hearty chili with cornbread recipe includes black beans, kidney beans, cumin, chili powder, and unsweetened cocoa powder for flavor.",
  "authors": [
    "SunnyDaysNora"
  ],
